<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Custom Wear – Design Your Tee</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* Base Styling */
        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-image: url('/images/pattern.png');
            background: #b5bfa1;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            width: 340px;
            margin: 1rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transform: scale(0.9);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #143109;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: #b5bfa1;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .content-box {
            background: #b5bfa1;
            color: #143109;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .slogan {
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            color: #143109;
        }

        .slogan .emoji {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        .slogan h2 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        .slogan .quote {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.9rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-dark {
            background-color: #143109;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-dark:hover {
            background-color: #0f2507;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .btn-light {
            background-color: #b5bfa1;
            color: #143109;
        }

        .btn-light:hover {
            background-color: #a2ac8e;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        footer {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes slideInLeft {
            from {
                transform: translateX(-50px);
                opacity: 0;
            }

            to {
                transform: translateX(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        @keyframes slideInTop {
            from {
                transform: translateY(-30px);
                opacity: 0;
            }

            to {
                transform: translateY(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        @keyframes scaleIn {
            from {
                transform: scale(0.9);
                opacity: 0;
            }

            to {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        /* Animation Classes */
        .fade-in {
            animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease;
        }

        .fade-in-delay {
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease;
        }

        .slide-in-left {
            animation: slideInLeft 1s ease;
        }

        .slide-in-top {
            animation: slideInTop 1s ease;
        }

        .scale-in {
            animation: scaleIn 1s ease-in;
        }

        /* Button Glow */
        .glow {
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(180, 200, 180, 0.5);
        }

        .glow:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(180, 200, 180, 0.7);
        }

        /* Responsive: Even smaller screens */
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .container {
                width: 300px;
            }

            .slogan .emoji {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <center>
        <div class="container fade-in">
            <h1 class="slide-in-top">👋 Hey Rajkot, Ready to Wear Your Imagination?</h1>
            <p class="tagline fade-in-delay">🎨 Design your own T-shirt – in just a few clicks!</p>

            <div class="content-box slide-in-left">
                <p><strong>✅ Choose Style (Cotton,Sports)</strong></p>
                <p><strong>✅ Select Color</strong></p>
                <p><strong>✅ Add Your Name, Text or Graphic</strong></p>
                <p><strong>✅ Front & Back Design Support</strong></p>
                <p><strong>🧵 We print. You wear. Simple.</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="slogan scale-in">
                <p class="emoji">❤️</p>
                <h2>🔥 Start Designing Now!</h2>
                <p class="quote">🚀 “Don’t wear what’s available.<br>Wear what’s <em>yours</em>.”</p>
            </div>

            <div class="buttons">
                <a href="https://www.customwear.co.in" class="btn btn-dark glow">Start Designing My Tee</a>
                <a href="https://instagram.com/customwear_official_" class="btn btn-light glow">Follow us on Instagram</a>
            </div>

            <footer class="fade-in-delay">
                Made with ❤️ in Rajkot<br />
                Contact - +91 9016123341
            </footer>
        </div>
    </center>
</body>

</html>